      "writtenOn": "2019-03-14T06:44:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we need to move this to Line after Line 160?\n\nThe point is if tethering provisioning is not required, provisionResponse is the same nor response is empty we do not need to assign the conf to mConfig. It does not look like a workable configuration change.",
