      "message": "Sure, I will add the comment here.\nI want to follow up TetherService existing design that running provisioning check sequentially. TetherService start running next check when it receive the result of previous check.\nHere, new provisioning request would just enqueue if size() \u003e 1. When EntitlementManager receive the provisioning result at line.511, it would process next one at line.539.",
